{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Clears all delivered notifications from the notification center."}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"clearNotificationCenter"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Removes all notifications delivered by your app from the iOS Notification Center.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"This is commonly used when:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"User opens the app (clear notifications since they’re viewing content)"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"User logs out (clear notifications for privacy)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Content is marked as read in-app","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Performing a “mark all as read” action","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only removes notifications from your app; other apps’ notifications are unaffected."}]},{"text":"Example","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Clear notifications on app activation and logout:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["class NotificationManager {","","    func applicationDidBecomeActive() {","        \/\/ Clear notifications when user opens app","        Pushwoosh.configure.clearNotificationCenter()","","        \/\/ Also reset badge","        UIApplication.shared.applicationIconBadgeNumber = 0","        Pushwoosh.configure.sendBadges(0)","    }","","    func handleUserLogout() {","        \/\/ Clear notifications for privacy","        Pushwoosh.configure.clearNotificationCenter()","","        \/\/ Unregister from push","        Pushwoosh.configure.unregisterForPushNotifications { _ in }","","        \/\/ Clear user identity","        Pushwoosh.configure.setUserId(\"\")","    }","","    func markAllAsRead() {","        \/\/ Clear from notification center","        Pushwoosh.configure.clearNotificationCenter()","","        \/\/ Update backend","        APIClient.shared.markAllNotificationsRead { _ in }","","        \/\/ Clear badge","        Pushwoosh.configure.sendBadges(0)","    }","}"]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/clearNotificationCenter"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/clearnotificationcenter"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"clearNotificationCenter"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)clearNotificationCenter","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"clearNotificationCenter","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","title":"clearNotificationCenter","role":"symbol"},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"type":"topic","title":"PWConfiguration","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"text":"PWConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","role":"symbol"},